            "review_title": "Review at Bread Factory",
            "review_text": "jblaza\nMarikina, Philippines692 contributions\n3\nthe quality of their baked goods is worth the premium paid\nFeb 2024 • Family\nWhile walking around the Hoan Kiem Lake, we chanced up a Bread Factory outlet, not far from McDonald’s. We grabbed some snacks before heading off to watch the Thang Long Puppet Show. \n\nWe sampled their French croissant and dinosaur egg bread. Their pastries are really tasty and of great quality. The French influence on their baked goods really shows.\n\nThey offered us water free of charge. Although not as cheap as other bakeries, the quality of their baked goods is worth the premium paid.\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2024",
