            "review_text": "B K\nGurugram (Gurgaon), India304 contributions\n0\nAwesome Preparations\nJun 2023 • Family\nBread Factory has a small outlet in Trang Tien right next to Mc Donalds on the prime intersection across the Lake.\nWe discovered it while hunting for some baked desserts.\nThe delectable variety of fares they offer including pastries , macarons, cakes , doughnuts and waffles made it a task for us to choose, so great did all their products looked.\nWe tried some doughnuts, cheesecake and a waffle topped up with whipped cream. It was delicious and highly recommended to everyone.The prices were incredibly reasonable for the quality of their food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 8, 2023",
